3. **Was the load rejected at the gate or after unloading?**
   At the gate, by the receiving kitchen's own check. Nothing was unloaded, so
   the product never entered the customer's premises. We hold photographs of
   the seal intact at rejection.

One point back to you. We still have no policy endorsement for the two vehicles
added in June. Please confirm in writing that cover applies from the **date of
addition** and not the date of endorsement. Two claims now sit behind that
sentence and we cannot close either.

